WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.890
Treasure Island

00:00:04.890 --> 00:00:06.740
DIE!

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Silver!

00:00:32.440 --> 00:00:33.630
Silver!

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:38.770
SILVER!

00:00:42.880 --> 00:00:43.600
Silver!

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:44.790
Silver!

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:46.240
Silver! Silver!

00:00:46.440 --> 00:00:47.180
Silver!

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:48.110
Silver!

00:00:48.920 --> 00:00:51.070
<i>Silver fell into the sea.</i>

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:53.030
<i>Silver and I...</i>

00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:54.600
<i>Me and Silver...</i>

00:00:54.600 --> 00:00:57.030
<i>He's a traitor and a murderer.</i>

00:00:57.840 --> 00:00:59.950
<i>But... but I...</i>

00:00:59.950 --> 00:01:02.120
<i>...refuse to believe that he's dead.</i>

00:01:02.520 --> 00:01:04.200
<i>Yes, I refuse to believe it!</i>

00:01:07.380 --> 00:01:10.940
Treasure
Island

00:01:07.380 --> 00:01:10.740
Takarajima

00:01:17.220 --> 00:01:19.550
saa ikou

00:01:17.220 --> 00:01:19.550
Come, let's go

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:22.640
yume ni mita shima heto

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:22.640
To the island that I've dreamed of

00:01:22.890 --> 00:01:26.480
nami wo koete kaze ni notte

00:01:22.890 --> 00:01:26.480
Across the waves, on the wind

00:01:26.730 --> 00:01:29.360
umi hedeyou

00:01:26.730 --> 00:01:29.360
We'll travel the oceans

00:01:29.770 --> 00:01:32.280
ikute ni wa

00:01:29.770 --> 00:01:32.280
Many of us

00:01:32.530 --> 00:01:35.280
minna mada shiranai

00:01:32.530 --> 00:01:35.280
Still don't know of

00:01:35.530 --> 00:01:39.030
fushigi na hiru to yoru toga

00:01:35.530 --> 00:01:39.030
The days and nights full of mystery

00:01:39.280 --> 00:01:41.530
matte iru darou

00:01:39.280 --> 00:01:41.530
That await us there

00:01:41.780 --> 00:01:45.040
itsumo shinji you

00:01:41.780 --> 00:01:45.040
We must always have trust

00:01:45.660 --> 00:01:48.290
magokoro wo

00:01:45.660 --> 00:01:48.290
And be sincere

00:01:48.790 --> 00:01:54.550
yuuki wo mune ni susumou yo

00:01:48.790 --> 00:01:54.550
And have courage in our hearts to move forward

00:01:54.840 --> 00:01:57.680
tade hitotsu no

00:01:54.840 --> 00:01:57.680
I only...

00:01:58.010 --> 00:02:01.100
akogare dake wa

00:01:58.010 --> 00:02:01.100
...have one desire

00:02:01.350 --> 00:02:03.390
doko no dare ni mo

00:02:01.350 --> 00:02:03.390
And no one...

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:10.100
kese wa shinai sa

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:10.100
...will ever take it away

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:16.650
tade hitotsu no

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:16.650
I only...

00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:19.950
akogare dake wa

00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:19.950
...have one desire

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:22.280
doko no dare ni mo

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:22.280
And no one...

00:02:22.580 --> 00:02:29.210
kese wa shinai sa

00:02:22.580 --> 00:02:29.210
...will ever take it away

00:02:35.470 --> 00:02:40.260
episode

00:02:35.470 --> 00:02:40.260
The Immortal Silver—
\h      Is this his End?

00:03:41.990 --> 00:03:44.320
I survived the storm!

00:03:44.670 --> 00:03:47.290
The Hispaniola stood strong!

00:04:00.170 --> 00:04:03.970
What luck! The ship is drifting towards the other side of the island!

00:04:04.790 --> 00:04:06.120
Benbow, come with me!

00:04:11.640 --> 00:04:14.560
Fifteen men...

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:18.020
...on a dead man's chest!

00:04:18.750 --> 00:04:23.090
Yo-ho-ho!
...and a bottle of rum!

00:04:23.090 --> 00:04:25.160
Drink and the devil...

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:29.080
...had done for the rest!

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:34.140
Yo-ho-ho!
...and a bottle...of...rum...

00:04:37.550 --> 00:04:40.020
Fifteen men...

00:04:40.020 --> 00:04:43.270
...on a dead man's chest!

00:04:44.070 --> 00:04:45.300
Yo-ho-ho!
...and—

00:05:04.180 --> 00:05:05.780
Benbow, brace for impact!

00:05:26.790 --> 00:05:28.260
Here goes!

00:05:37.350 --> 00:05:39.770
Benbow, you think the fort held out?

00:05:39.770 --> 00:05:41.880
Dr. Livesey, Mr. Trelawney...

00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:43.590
...and Captain Smollett.

00:05:43.590 --> 00:05:45.190
I hope they're alright!

00:06:07.310 --> 00:06:08.260
I think...

00:06:08.660 --> 00:06:12.350
...I have it docked in one of the island's northern bays.

00:06:13.550 --> 00:06:15.930
So if I'm North, then...

00:06:15.930 --> 00:06:18.790
Geez, then I must be on the
other side of the island, right?

00:06:19.790 --> 00:06:21.210
I'll have to hurry...

00:06:23.630 --> 00:06:26.280
...if I want to reach the fort before dark.

00:06:55.990 --> 00:06:57.540
Silver, Silver!

00:07:00.070 --> 00:07:02.610
Silver, Silver, Silver!

00:07:13.180 --> 00:07:14.910
<i>Damn... it.</i>

00:07:32.150 --> 00:07:33.670
Keep an eye out, Benbow.

00:07:33.670 --> 00:07:37.080
The pirates must be surrounding the fort.

00:07:54.470 --> 00:07:56.470
I've made it!
I've finally made it!

00:07:58.230 --> 00:08:00.500
They really took a hit, though...

00:08:01.020 --> 00:08:03.580
The fort's been blasted to bits, huh?

00:08:03.580 --> 00:08:05.300
Okay, let's go, Benbow.

00:08:07.950 --> 00:08:10.810
Dammit, it's one of their cannon balls!

00:08:10.810 --> 00:08:11.940
Dirty thing!

00:08:20.770 --> 00:08:23.490
Strange, it's very quiet.

00:08:24.090 --> 00:08:27.730
What's more, no one's keeping watch...

00:08:29.570 --> 00:08:30.550
Let's go.

00:08:36.290 --> 00:08:38.450
Was everybody wiped out?

00:09:10.930 --> 00:09:13.490
Pieces of eight! Pieces of eight!

00:09:13.490 --> 00:09:16.450
Pieces of eight! Pieces of eight!

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:17.410
Pieces of eight!

00:09:17.250 --> 00:09:18.530
Flint!

00:09:30.380 --> 00:09:31.420
Silver!

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:39.010
S-Silver!
Silver, you're alive!

00:09:40.930 --> 00:09:42.970
Quick, get away from here!

00:09:44.010 --> 00:09:44.990
Hurry!

00:09:47.250 --> 00:09:49.400
What is it, Captain Silver?

00:09:54.500 --> 00:09:56.030
What now?
I-It's Jim!

00:09:56.720 --> 00:09:57.860
What, Jim?

00:09:58.810 --> 00:09:59.660
Jim, you say?

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:04.250
You're not getting away!

00:10:08.050 --> 00:10:10.310
Come back here, you brat!

00:10:10.310 --> 00:10:12.510
Stay still, little bastard!

00:10:27.930 --> 00:10:31.450
You're not very smart, Jim.
You've thrown yourself...

00:10:31.450 --> 00:10:33.500
...into the lion's den.

00:10:34.130 --> 00:10:35.320
The fort has fallen?

00:10:38.150 --> 00:10:40.110
Dirty beast!
Stay put!

00:10:41.210 --> 00:10:43.450
George, what are you going to do with him?

00:10:43.850 --> 00:10:47.040
Let's see...
It's not worth it to torture him.

00:10:47.490 --> 00:10:51.000
Guess we could do it the pirate way.

00:10:51.380 --> 00:10:53.130
The pirate way?

00:10:58.930 --> 00:10:59.680
En garde!

00:11:01.440 --> 00:11:04.790
Whad'ya say, lad?
How about we have a little duel?

00:11:19.050 --> 00:11:21.810
Spill his blood, my fellow wolves!

00:11:21.810 --> 00:11:25.280
Then spread it on the ground...

00:11:25.280 --> 00:11:27.870
That will be the sign of victory!

00:12:18.050 --> 00:12:20.300
You're doing well, kid.

00:12:24.570 --> 00:12:27.760
But now, playtime is over.
It's time to finish this.

00:13:03.260 --> 00:13:05.470
George, you're the best!

00:13:16.370 --> 00:13:20.290
He's fainted and isn't going to wake up anytime soon.

00:13:20.930 --> 00:13:23.210
Spill his blood, brother wolf!

00:13:23.210 --> 00:13:27.320
Take away the curse and lead us to victory!

00:13:27.320 --> 00:13:31.450
Kill him, or when three shooting stars appear,

00:13:31.450 --> 00:13:34.290
this boy will put a curse on us!

00:13:38.880 --> 00:13:41.840
Look, he speaks the truth.
Three shooting stars...

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:45.400
Kill him, kill him.
Kill him!

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:47.300
Kill him, kill him!

00:13:47.300 --> 00:13:50.720
Kill him, kill him, kill him, kill him...

00:14:00.940 --> 00:14:03.440
That's enough!
George, stop!

00:14:04.900 --> 00:14:09.490
The fight is over.
It's best you stop now.

00:14:09.850 --> 00:14:12.610
What?
Are you mad?

00:14:12.610 --> 00:14:14.890
It's the pirate law.

00:14:14.890 --> 00:14:17.210
To win, he must kill his opponent.

00:14:17.210 --> 00:14:19.920
The rules of the duel apply to everyone.

00:14:19.920 --> 00:14:21.770
I know, George...

00:14:21.770 --> 00:14:24.050
But you're fighting against a child.

00:14:24.050 --> 00:14:27.400
Besides, you knew from
the start that you'd win.

00:14:27.400 --> 00:14:28.870
So spare him.

00:14:30.070 --> 00:14:32.550
Color me surprised.
This isn't like you.

00:14:32.890 --> 00:14:36.350
What about the rules?
Child or not, a duel's a duel!

00:14:36.350 --> 00:14:41.980
Hey now, Morgan, you too are questioning my authority?

00:14:43.490 --> 00:14:44.730
Don't give in, Morgan!

00:14:44.730 --> 00:14:47.110
We don't have to obey him if he doesn't respect our law!

00:14:47.110 --> 00:14:49.950
Th-That's right!
I refuse to obey, Silver!

00:14:50.610 --> 00:14:52.690
Not "Silver".

00:14:52.690 --> 00:14:55.580
"<i>Captain</i>  Silver".

00:15:21.530 --> 00:15:25.610
Anyone else want to call me "Silver"?

00:15:39.430 --> 00:15:41.230
Look, guys...

00:15:41.230 --> 00:15:44.590
So far, I've agreed to obey Silver's orders.

00:15:44.930 --> 00:15:49.690
For better or worse, I thought he was an ideal pirate.

00:15:49.690 --> 00:15:53.570
But now that I see he's sided with this kid, I can't remain quiet!

00:15:53.570 --> 00:15:55.930
That's true!
George is right.

00:15:55.930 --> 00:15:59.350
Furthermore, all his plans so far
have ended in failure.

00:15:59.770 --> 00:16:02.360
All he did was work us to death!

00:16:02.870 --> 00:16:07.490
As it stands, we'll be too worn out by the time we reach the treasure!

00:16:07.490 --> 00:16:10.510
Forget about even grabbing a single piece of gold!

00:16:10.510 --> 00:16:14.070
To begin with, all we want is to get our share of the treasure.

00:16:14.070 --> 00:16:16.730
But what can we do?

00:16:18.040 --> 00:16:22.790
So mates, what if we held a
meeting without Silver, huh?

00:16:25.290 --> 00:16:27.770
Leave, O old stars!

00:16:27.770 --> 00:16:30.690
Let a new star come to us!

00:16:30.690 --> 00:16:34.370
The men await the divine light.

00:16:34.370 --> 00:16:35.800
Lord, bring us Your light!

00:16:35.800 --> 00:16:36.600
Lord...

00:16:36.600 --> 00:16:37.930
Your light...

00:16:43.140 --> 00:16:45.300
Hey, you guys listening?

00:16:45.300 --> 00:16:47.190
Abraham himself has said it.

00:16:47.640 --> 00:16:49.700
The old stars will leave.

00:16:50.170 --> 00:16:52.990
It's time to make some changes to the roster.

00:17:00.490 --> 00:17:05.210
It doesn't matter that you lost.
You fought well, Jim.

00:17:16.860 --> 00:17:21.180
Despite that awful storm, how did you manage to survive, Silver?

00:17:30.840 --> 00:17:32.700
There was a barrel.

00:17:32.700 --> 00:17:36.240
I hung onto it and managed to reach the island.

00:17:36.660 --> 00:17:40.820
Thanks for being worried about me, Jim.

00:17:47.260 --> 00:17:50.300
And those from the fort...
What's become of them?

00:17:50.300 --> 00:17:52.860
Why were you in the fort?

00:17:52.860 --> 00:17:55.900
Have you killed them?
Have you murdered them all?!

00:17:55.900 --> 00:17:58.430
That's it, isn't it?!
You've killed them all!

00:17:58.430 --> 00:17:59.680
Damn you!

00:18:00.640 --> 00:18:02.940
Calm down, Jim.
Don't worry.

00:18:02.940 --> 00:18:04.880
Your friends are all alive.

00:18:04.880 --> 00:18:07.810
I'll tell you everything.
So, listen to me.

00:18:08.520 --> 00:18:11.270
<i>The sun was already high.</i>

00:18:11.270 --> 00:18:15.300
<i>I had just reached the shore
when they came to inform me.</i>

00:18:16.780 --> 00:18:19.320
<i>Those at the fort had raised the white flag.</i>

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:30.880
Silver, we have to talk to you!

00:18:30.880 --> 00:18:33.340
Go ahead, I'm listening!

00:18:33.340 --> 00:18:37.180
We don't have any more water or food.
We propose a truce.

00:18:37.180 --> 00:18:39.050
A truce under certain conditions.

00:18:39.380 --> 00:18:41.010
Tell me your conditions!

00:18:43.260 --> 00:18:46.750
I think that this map is what you want!

00:18:51.620 --> 00:18:53.420
The truce was concluded.

00:18:53.420 --> 00:18:56.000
We provided them with food and water...

00:18:56.000 --> 00:18:58.660
...and let them leave the fort.

00:19:00.240 --> 00:19:02.540
But what I can't explain...

00:19:02.540 --> 00:19:05.240
...is why they let us have the map.

00:19:06.090 --> 00:19:08.210
Yes, that must be it!

00:19:08.210 --> 00:19:11.610
They learned by heart everything that was written on it.

00:19:11.610 --> 00:19:13.730
So they don't need it anymore.

00:19:14.500 --> 00:19:19.220
Mr. Trelawney and the others must already be in search of the treasure.

00:19:19.220 --> 00:19:19.850
I know it!

00:19:19.850 --> 00:19:20.780
Ridiculous.

00:19:20.780 --> 00:19:24.490
We kept them in a cave near here to keep an eye on them...

00:19:24.490 --> 00:19:26.830
...and to prevent them
from taking the treasure.

00:19:32.400 --> 00:19:35.650
Besides, many of us have malaria...

00:19:35.650 --> 00:19:38.320
...so we need Dr. Livesey.

00:19:48.200 --> 00:19:50.080
Silver, open your ears wide!

00:19:50.080 --> 00:19:52.120
We've held a meeting without you!

00:19:52.610 --> 00:19:55.890
There, we've decided to give you something!

00:19:55.890 --> 00:19:58.090
It's this: the Black Spot!

00:20:02.410 --> 00:20:03.840
The Black Spot?

00:20:04.330 --> 00:20:05.840
All the men agree.

00:20:05.840 --> 00:20:08.890
From this point on,
you're no longer our leader!

00:20:11.290 --> 00:20:14.250
Come out of there, Silver!
It's the Black Spot!

00:20:14.250 --> 00:20:17.820
You're banished from pirating!
Come on, get here and take it!

00:20:21.890 --> 00:20:25.370
Silver, don't do this.
Don't take the Black Spot!

00:20:25.370 --> 00:20:28.240
Billy Bones got it and he's dead!

00:20:29.170 --> 00:20:32.050
Jim, I've already told you:

00:20:32.050 --> 00:20:36.070
I don't believe in God, the Devil nor any superstition.

00:20:36.790 --> 00:20:41.680
So you see, this isn't going to bother me.

00:20:41.680 --> 00:20:42.670
I'll be fine.

00:21:01.370 --> 00:21:03.130
This is the black spot.

00:21:03.130 --> 00:21:05.950
And, who's going to replace me as leader?

00:21:06.840 --> 00:21:09.410
That be me.
Your old friend, George.

00:21:09.410 --> 00:21:11.850
I've had enough of being thrashed around!

00:21:11.850 --> 00:21:13.560
Now it's my turn!

00:21:14.790 --> 00:21:19.040
George, couldn't you have made a Black Spot
that's a bit more convincing?

00:21:19.040 --> 00:21:23.800
You really believed that this piece of paper would scare me?

00:21:37.310 --> 00:21:40.770
What do you take me for?!
You filthy rats!

00:21:59.370 --> 00:22:00.590
Silver, behind you!

00:22:01.750 --> 00:22:03.050
Dirty dog!

00:22:15.390 --> 00:22:17.230
Silver!

00:22:17.580 --> 00:22:20.190
Now's our chance, guys!
Tie him up!

00:22:28.720 --> 00:22:32.580
To      be        continued

00:22:33.550 --> 00:22:38.590
shiokaze yo omae mo

00:22:33.550 --> 00:22:38.590
Hey sea breeze

00:22:38.590 --> 00:22:44.400
tomodachi naraba tsutaete

00:22:38.590 --> 00:22:44.400
If you're my friend then carry

00:22:45.620 --> 00:22:50.610
furusato ni nokoshite kita

00:22:45.620 --> 00:22:50.610
To my home that I've left behind

00:22:50.610 --> 00:22:56.050
natsukashii haha ni hitokoto

00:22:50.610 --> 00:22:56.050
A word to my dear mother

00:22:56.050 --> 00:23:01.460
boku wa genki de yattemasu

00:22:56.050 --> 00:23:01.460
Tell her that I'm doing fine

00:23:01.460 --> 00:23:06.920
kaban ippai no

00:23:01.460 --> 00:23:06.920
And that my bag filled

00:23:06.920 --> 00:23:12.550
nozomi to yume to takaramono

00:23:06.920 --> 00:23:12.550
With hopes, dreams and treasures

00:23:12.550 --> 00:23:18.410
kakaete kaeritai

00:23:12.550 --> 00:23:18.410
Will be brought back

00:23:19.500 --> 00:23:25.000
yuuyake wo senaka ni

00:23:19.500 --> 00:23:25.000
The sunset on my back

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:30.890
kamome wo kata ni tomarasete

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:30.890
And a seagull perched on my shoulder

00:23:30.890 --> 00:23:40.610
boku wa fukimasu kuchibue wo

00:23:30.890 --> 00:23:40.610
I blow out a whistle

00:23:45.650 --> 00:23:46.980
They want to roast him?!

00:23:46.980 --> 00:23:50.910
Even if he's called Barbecue, they can't do that!

00:23:50.910 --> 00:23:52.300
It's impossible!

00:23:52.810 --> 00:23:54.890
Poor Long John Silver...

00:23:54.890 --> 00:23:58.160
...is in a sorry state,
attached to a cross.

00:23:58.160 --> 00:24:00.650
The pirates are drunk with anger...

00:24:00.650 --> 00:24:03.770
...and want to execute him at dawn.

00:24:03.770 --> 00:24:07.490
Next time on Treasure Island:
"This Time it's Long John's Crucifixion!"

00:24:07.490 --> 00:24:10.010
Here he stands at the gates of hell!

